---
import AboutHeroImage from "../assets/Headshot.jpg";
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Me"
  description="Game and Graphics Programmer"
  pubDate={new Date("August 25 2026")}
  heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
  project=""
>
  <p>
    Hello! I'm Chase and I'm a game and graphics programmer. I have been
    programming for a little over seven years now and have experience in
    numerous engines and languages. I got my Bachelor's Degree at Chico State in
    Computer Animation and Game Development and am currently pursuing my
    Master's Degree in Interactive Media & Immersive Audio Technologies at Chico
    State.
  </p>

  <p>
    I have extensive knowledge for both Unity and Unreal with six years of
    experience in Unity and two in Unreal. I know an incredible amount of
    programming languages that I use almost daily which include: C#, C++, Java,
    Go, JavaScript, CG, HLSL. I also know how to use a lot of technology
    programming adjacent like Vulkan, OpenGL, Unity: Jobs, Burst, UI Toolkit,
    Unreal: UMG, Blueprints, Tasks, Chaos.
  </p>

  <p>
    Currently I work as the lead software engineer for a local company <i>Ashen Sky Studio LLC</i> where I am in charge of all engineers and engineering work at the company.
  </p>
</Layout>
